WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:10.270
Brought to you by Guodong Subs

00:00:10.430 --> 00:00:13.360
We do not own the copyright. Only for academic exchange purpose.
Welcome to watch it on the official channel

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:24.860
Pass through boundaries of life and death, stride over the peak of the sky

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:32.060
Look at this dim dark sky from the distance

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:42.190
Glowing tears on fair skin

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:47.930
Melt this dark night

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:52.730
Souls entwine both on watch

00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:58.460
Protect the candle-like warmth

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:03.790
Under the night sky sunflowers are swaying in the wind

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:06.390
As the night will always pass by

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:11.260
Let's embrace the new dawn

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:14.990
Fleeting Meteor

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:18.390
Broke the silence of the sky

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:22.730
Call for new heroes with my remaining brightness

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:25.260
Burn out the flame of life in the wind

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:27.590
Penetrate the endless horizon

00:01:27.590 --> 00:01:29.930
Cross over the long night to another end

00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:32.990
Search for that destination

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:35.660
Fly towards the other side of my dream

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.760
Episode 10

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:57.930
Oh my! What a powerful maidservant, I want a dozen

00:01:58.130 --> 00:01:59.930
Aye young master, I will make the arrangement immediately

00:02:02.730 --> 00:02:05.000
Hello, Buy young master a dozen maidservants

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:07.800
Cosplay of maidservants from ancient times

00:02:22.730 --> 00:02:25.260
Senior Zhao, there isn't any relationship between us

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.460
please don't trouble Ma Yingxiong anymore in the future

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:30.800
Or I won't be gentle

00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:37.060
What's wrong with this world?

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:43.200
I, Mr perfect, am unexpectedly refused by a girl, oh my god

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:45.460
Young master, wait for me, young master

00:02:48.530 --> 00:02:49.060
Young master

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:53.200
Master, do you want to drink some tea?

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:08.860
Why is there a weapon spirit?

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.800
I am a weapon spirit with a contract for the conclusion of master's blood

00:03:12.060 --> 00:03:16.200
You've already trained the weapon spirit this well in just one night?

00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:17.860
A weapon spirit with consciousness

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:23.200
I see, I remember you having a powerful Cultivation weapon

00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:31.130
You can't tell anyone about the encounter between us, including my posterity

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:35.660
Otherwise, I won't let you rest easy, the matter where you regarded me as a woman will also count in.

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:38.660
The Hun Tian Beads are related to Xuan Zi's ancestor, I can't her tell anything about the secret

00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:44.130
I don't know where it came from, maybe...

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:47.000
It was a favor from the heavens

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:51.930
Then what's your name?

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:56.060
Maybe we can infer the situation of cultivation weapon from your identity

00:03:56.060 --> 00:03:58.060
I have no name

00:03:58.460 --> 00:03:59.660
No name?

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:03.530
That's awkward, then we'll have to give you a name

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:07.530
We can't always call her weapon spirit or fantoccini

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:16.860
I've got an idea, as you look like a slave

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:19.130
We can call you Ya Huan(slavey)

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:21.200
That sounds unpleasent

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:28.930
Then, since you are weapon spirit, how about Ling Er(ling means spirit)

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:33.200
If master likes it, I'll accept that name

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:35.930
I think you might like everything from your master

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:37.660
What an old-fashioned name

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:39.200
Thanks

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:45.130
Then I'm going to prepare the Yang flame Array

00:04:45.530 --> 00:04:47.860
This battle relates to all our lives, let's hope we can survive

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:53.060
I need to prepare too

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:55.460
Yingxiong，You also need to think about

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:58.600
finding a way of escape for when your life is at stake

00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:01.400
Why do you all have no confidence in me?

00:05:03.060 --> 00:05:05.600
Master, they are right

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:08.330
You need to improve your cultivation level to prevent danger

00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:13.130
This is all because I'm too weak

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:16.800
Master has a good cultivation level but lacks combat capability

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:19.460
Miss Muzi must be worried about you

00:05:19.860 --> 00:05:22.260
I don't want to always hide behind women

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:25.530
Then, master please follow me

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:35.130
This is..

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:44.060
Yingxiong, I hope Ling Er can teach you some way of escaping,

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:48.800
because when we battle the Core Formation monster
we have no chance of winning.

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:05.310
Master, this is the world inside the Hun Tian Beads

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:24.370
It's hard to believe that there is so much space inside such a small ball

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:27.440
There are countless miraculous weapon spirits and weapons in the cultivation world

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:30.910
Originally, I was an intellegent weapon spirit which was made by

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:32.770
my original master through

00:06:32.770 --> 00:06:36.110
using ten kinds of unique treasure and was put in the cold realm with ten years worth of pure spirit energy

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:45.510
That's so miraculous, you must be so powerful

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:48.710
I have high cultivation level

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:51.710
but exactly how much can be released depends on master's cultivation level

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:54.110
If you want to release my full ability

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:57.170
You must reach the Early-Stage of Ascendant Soul

00:06:57.970 --> 00:07:00.040
But after all, you have strong cultivation level

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:04.310
In theory, there should be some way in which you can eliminate that Core Formation monster

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:06.570
Even just once is enough

00:07:06.770 --> 00:07:11.640
Em..Indeed I do have a way that can eliminate him

00:07:12.310 --> 00:07:13.110
But

00:07:14.570 --> 00:07:16.710
I might not be able to see you again

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:20.440
Would it require offering you up as a sacrifice or something like that?

00:07:20.970 --> 00:07:24.910
Yes, if you command me

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:28.370
or do awkward things to me

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:33.110
it will trigger a spontaneous detonation and cause hundreds of miles of barren waste

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:39.240
Nononono, no matter what happens

00:07:39.570 --> 00:07:41.310
I won't let you be used that way

00:07:43.510 --> 00:07:44.370
Thanks master

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:48.310
But there's still one problem that confuses me

00:07:48.510 --> 00:07:49.910
Could I help?

00:07:50.840 --> 00:07:53.910
I have more powerful spirit energy than Muzi

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:55.440
but i'm still weak

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:58.110
My strength is less than a Qi Condensation level cultivator

00:07:58.770 --> 00:08:01.510
Cultivators' strength comes from the Essence of heaven and earth

00:08:02.110 --> 00:08:04.710
Being turned to spirit energy by circling governor and conception vessels

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:07.310
Master's spirit energy came from others

00:08:07.570 --> 00:08:09.240
Not from your own cultivation

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:12.110
You lack the understanding of how to use spirit energy

00:08:12.570 --> 00:08:15.040
Which means you have spirit energy that you don't know how to use

00:08:15.310 --> 00:08:18.510
You can't use you ability once you get nervous in battle

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:21.770
How come, then how can I use my current spirit energy?

00:08:22.570 --> 00:08:23.510
I have a solution

00:08:31.170 --> 00:08:33.440
Is..isn't this a gesture of co-cultivation?

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:35.440
Could she need to co-cultivate to

00:08:35.710 --> 00:08:37.040
transmit spirit energy to me?

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:41.510
Awkward things trigger spontaneous detonation

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:48.640
Ling Er, Ling Er, are we going to perish together such like with the tortoise?

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:50.970
Wait, I'm not a tortoise

00:08:51.570 --> 00:08:53.710
What's wrong, master? What are you saying?

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:55.710
Why are you making that gesture?

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:57.510
Do you feel cold?

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:01.570
Nothing, just a little itch

00:09:03.910 --> 00:09:04.440
Go on

00:09:04.570 --> 00:09:07.440
You're so naive, I shouldn't think like that

00:09:07.870 --> 00:09:11.870
Please sit down and close your eyes, I will guide the spirit energy for you

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:34.640
Master, what's up?

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:37.640
Nothing, I just feel itchy

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:39.570
Could you go down more

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:43.510
You need to overcome a little, calm down and feel the circling of the spirit energy

00:09:44.240 --> 00:09:44.770
ok

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:11.570
How do you feel?

00:10:14.110 --> 00:10:17.770
This feels special, I can use spirit energy freely in this way, right?

00:10:18.770 --> 00:10:21.370
Your cultivating speed is fast

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:25.440
You will be able to use spirit energy skillfully with 5 to 10 years of cultivation

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:28.910
Oh mh, the battle is coming, I don't have time to cultivate

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:31.510
If that's so, there is another way

00:10:32.840 --> 00:10:33.710
What's that?

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:37.040
I can use my spirit energy to help master

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:38.710
to circle governor and conception vessels

00:10:38.710 --> 00:10:40.970
Just like how warriors opened their governor and conception vessels

00:10:40.970 --> 00:10:43.310
You would be able to freely use your spirit energy

00:10:43.310 --> 00:10:46.970
But, when receiving such powerful spirit energy

00:10:46.970 --> 00:10:49.440
the process will be very painful

00:10:49.510 --> 00:10:50.840
It's ok, just do it

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:53.910
Then I'll start

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:15.170
This is so painful, but compared with Muzi and Ruyue's sadness and shock, it's nothing

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:20.240
If you can't bear this, you can...

00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:23.970
No, I can do it, just keep going

00:11:45.110 --> 00:11:48.240
Master didn't yell at all even when you were in so much pain, that's admirable

00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:51.510
I am called Yingxiong(hero)

00:11:56.420 --> 00:11:57.080
Master be careful

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:07.190
Waken at nightfall  It's the whisper of waves

00:12:07.190 --> 00:12:12.920
The scenery outside the window is dyed red by the afterglow

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:21.320
Scattered time   Blank mood

00:12:21.390 --> 00:12:26.120
No one is along with me to the dawn time

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:34.450
Wind is passed   Ear is listening

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:39.990
Could I hear the sound of your heart beat?

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:47.990
Let this wind blows hair to the air

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:54.790
Pitter-patter is perpetual Bit bit drops into my heart

00:12:54.790 --> 00:13:01.790
Rose in the vase rises her white body sideways

00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:06.920
It rejects of dying alone
